        },
        {
          "text": " Neiteng'enisho anaa ake te nkaji e Nkai. Neing'oru ilapolosak kituaak, o lasirak o ltung'ana kituaak le ilo orere pee eidaikie ninye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.47",
